You have a special affinity for darkness and shadows.

When standing in an unlit grid, the minimum range to your foes for activating stealth or for maintaining it after a Shadow Dance is reduced by [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)].

While stealthed, your life regeneration is increased by [5.5, 6.8, 8.0, 9.0, 10 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] (based on your Cunning) and your stamina regeneration is increased by [1.0, 1.5, 1.9, 2.2, 2.5 (TL1-5)].  The regeneration effects persist for [3, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns after exiting stealth, with 5 times the normal rate.
